  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: Why does the order of amino acids affect the properties of a peptide?
  - language: German
    text: "Warum beeinflusst die Reihenfolge der Aminos\xE4uren die Eigenschaften
      eines Peptids?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because only the last amino acid is active
    - language: German
      text: "Weil nur die letzte Aminos\xE4ure aktiv ist"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because the peptide bond is polar
    - language: German
      text: Weil die Peptidbindung polar ist
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because of the specific properties of the side chains (polarity, charge,
        etc.)
    - language: German
      text: "Wegen der spezifischen Seitenketten-Eigenschaften (Polarit\xE4t, Ladung
        etc.)"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: The order is irrelevant
    - language: German
      text: Die Reihenfolge ist ohne Bedeutung
  correctAnswer: 4
